        "rumi": "Ara-aita in kana 'alal hudaa",
        "translation": "Adakah engkau nampak (buruknya) jika ia berada di atas jalan yang betul? -",
        "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6117.mp3"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "arabic": "أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ",
